        "headline": "High Wind Warning issued October 20 at 1:55AM AKDT until October 20 at 10:00PM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...South winds 30 to 40 mph with gusts up to 65 mph.\n\n* WHERE...Municipality of Skagway.\n\n* WHEN...Until 10 PM AKDT this evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...High winds will blow around unsecured objects, damage\nproperty and cause power outages. Travel will be difficult.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Winds will remain elevated through Tuesday\nmorning, with the strongest gusts peaking through midday Tuesday.",
